  - explainer-video
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill that turns a JSON storyboard into narrated explainer and
  training videos. Rendering uses Remotion. TTS, image and music generation are
  pluggable across OpenRouter, any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, Alibaba DashScope
  and Volcengine. Cuts are beat-synced, the music ducks under the voice, and QA
  scripts are included.
